{
  "title": "Exotic Egyptian Pork Kebabs",
  "description": "Tangy and silky Egyptian dish featuring pork back ribs, perfect for a brunch mood, with a Whole30 friendly twist using kombu cold extract.",
  "cuisine": "Egyptian",
  "diet": [
    "whole30",
